  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:420px;padding:48px 40px;">
    <div style="max-width:720px;text-align:center;">
      <h6 style="text-align:center;">Recuperative Care Program</h6>
      <p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">The&nbsp;Recuperative Care Program&nbsp;provides short- term shelter&nbsp;and&nbsp;case management to homeless people&nbsp;who are recovering from an acute illness or injury, whose conditions would be exacerbated by living&nbsp;on the&nbsp;street.<br><br>&nbsp;SERVICES Provided<br>Housing for adult men and women Case management<br><br>Location: 1603 N Florida Ave, Tampa 33602</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
